    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about bias but it feels way deeper than just \"noticing things.\" it's like the universe is actually responding to my focus. every time i get really intense about a new goal or a project, these \"glitches\" start happening faster. it's like if i lean into the thought hard enough, the world actually shifts to match it. does that even make sense? or am i just crazy?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
